### Variables: start the server with `cds watch` first (port 4004)
@host = http://localhost:4004
@base = {{host}}/odata/v4/po

### 1. All POs
GET {{base}}/PurchaseOrders

### 2. Late POs (dueDate before 2026-11-03 AND not fully delivered)
GET {{base}}/PurchaseOrders?$filter=dueDate%20lt%202026-11-03%20and%20deliveredQty%20lt%20orderedQty&$expand=vendor

### 3. Sorted by due date
GET {{base}}/PurchaseOrders?$orderby=dueDate

### 4. With vendor details
GET {{base}}/PurchaseOrders?$expand=vendor

### 5. Create PO with amount 0 (expect 400)
POST {{base}}/PurchaseOrders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "poNumber": "4500020",
  "vendor_ID": "V001",
  "dueDate": "2026-12-01",
  "orderedQty": 10,
  "deliveredQty": 0,
  "amount": 0
}

### 6. Create a valid PO (expect 201)
POST {{base}}/PurchaseOrders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "poNumber": "4500020",
  "vendor_ID": "V001",
  "dueDate": "2026-12-01",
  "orderedQty": 10,
  "deliveredQty": 0,
  "amount": 50000.00
}
